Data and libraries loaded at run time (not vendored):

  - Sentinel-2 tiling grid: ESA, S2A_OPER_GIP_TILPAR_MPC__20151209T095117_
    V20150622T000000_21000101T000000_B00.kml (Copernicus Sentinel data
    terms). Converted to a compact grid by src/swathcast/s2grid.py.
  - @photostructure/tz-lookup 11.7.0 (CC0-1.0), loaded from jsDelivr by the
    map to show local time at a footprint.
  - sgp4 (Python, MIT) in the schedule job, for Sentinel-2 tile timing.
  - MapLibre GL JS 5.24.0 (BSD-3-Clause) and satellite.js 6.0.2 (MIT), from
    cdnjs; OpenStreetMap tiles (ODbL); orbital elements from CelesTrak
    (celestrak.org), refreshed by the poll job.
  - d3-geo 3.1.1 and topojson-client 3.1.0 (ISC), from jsDelivr, for the map's
    polar inset; its coastlines are world-atlas 2.0.2 land-110m (ISC), from
    Natural Earth (public domain).
